<div class="chapter_content content" id="7684007_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="history">[HISTORY: Adopted by the Common Council of the City of Albany 7-18-1983 by L.L. No. 2-1983 as Ch. XXII of the 1983 Code. Amendments noted where applicable.]</div><aside class="chapterrefblock"><h2 class="generalReferencesTitle">GENERAL REFERENCES</h2><div class="para">Building construction — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7681109" href="7681109#7681109">133</a>.</div><div class="para">Plumbing — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7683839" href="7683839#7683839">261</a>.</div><div class="para">Pollution — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7683870" href="7683870#7683870">267</a>.</div><div class="para">Streets and sidewalks — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7684666" href="7684666#7684666">323</a>.</div><div class="para">Water and waterways — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7686107" href="7686107#7686107">371</a>.</div></aside><div class="footnotes"></div></div>


